AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_i", "mark-i", "Built in a cave with a box of scraps. Slow, loud, and absolutely unstoppable at arm's length.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_ii", "mark-ii", "The bare-chrome flight prototype. Just watch out for icing above 30,000 feet.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_iii", "mark-iii", "Hot-rod red with a little gold. The suit that made the world say his name.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_iv", "mark-iv", "Refined, reliable, and party-ready. A balanced workhorse with a chest beam to spare.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_v", "mark-v", "Fits in a briefcase, unfolds in seconds. Perfect for when the race track turns into a war zone.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_vi", "mark-vi", "Powered by a brand-new element and a triangular reactor. Its wrist lasers slice drones in half.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_vii", "mark-vii", "Fired from a pod and wrapped around him mid-fall. Loaded with micro-missiles for an alien invasion.")
AI_LINE(Edith, SuitIntro, "EDITH_intro_mark_xv_sneaky", "mark-xv-sneaky", "Matte gray plating and a reflective cloaking skin. You won't see it until it's already behind you.")
AI_LINE(Edith, SuitIntro, "EDITH_intro_mark_xvi_nightclub", "mark-xvi-nightclub", "Midnight-black and radar-silent. Built for the jobs nobody is supposed to know about.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xvii_heartbreaker", "mark-xvii-heartbreaker", "An oversized chest reactor that fires a world-class unibeam. It breaks hearts and anything behind them.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xx_python", "mark-xx-python", "A long-range cruiser with extended fuel cells. Picks targets off from miles away.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xxi_midas", "mark-xxi-midas", "Solid gold from helmet to boots. A high-altitude flyer that turns every sunset into a flex.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xxii_hot_rod", "mark-xxii-hot-rod", "Candy-apple red and built to burn rubber in the sky. Floor it and hold on.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xxiii_shades", "mark-xxiii-shades", "Rated for the hottest and coldest extremes. Its cryo-repulsors flash-freeze anything that gets too close.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xxv_striker", "mark-xxv-striker", "A construction suit with hydraulic fists. One punch sends a concussive wave through concrete.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xxvii_disco", "mark-xxvii-disco", "Shifting mirrored plates throw light in every direction. Its energy whip keeps the party in check.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xxxiii_silver_centurion", "mark-xxxiii-silver-centurion", "A classic silver-and-crimson tribute. Its energy shield shrugs off fire while its reactor hums.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xxxviii_igor", "mark-xxxviii-igor", "A towering heavy-lifter built to hold up collapsing towers. It moves slowly, and nothing moves it.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xl_shotgun", "mark-xl-shotgun", "Built for hypersonic speed. By the time you hear the boom, it's already gone.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xli_bones", "mark-xli-bones", "A skeletal frame with almost no armor. Light, fast, and able to break apart to dodge a hit.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xlii", "mark-xlii", "Every plate flies in on its own command. Prehensile, temperamental, and armed to the teeth.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xliii", "mark-xliii", "Upgraded for a team that fights gods and robots. It hits the ground with a unibeam already charged.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xlv", "mark-xlv", "Leader of the Iron Legion. It calls a squadron of drones into the fight.")
AI_LINE(Jarvis, SuitIntro, "JARVIS_intro_mark_xlvi", "mark-xlvi", "Built in the workshop for a war between friends. Its deployable shield takes a beating and hits back.")
AI_LINE(Friday, SuitIntro, "FRIDAY_intro_mark_xlvii", "mark-xlvii", "Can fly itself across the globe on autopilot. When it arrives, it brings a unibeam.")
AI_LINE(Friday, SuitIntro, "FRIDAY_intro_mark_l", "mark-l", "Billions of nanobots wait inside the housing on its chest. Whatever weapon he imagines, the suit builds.")
AI_LINE(Friday, SuitIntro, "FRIDAY_intro_mark_lxxxv", "mark-lxxxv", "The last suit: more gold and more resilient nanotech. Built for the endgame.")
AI_LINE(WarMachine, SuitIntro, "WARMACHINE_intro_war_machine", "war-machine", "Gunmetal plating, a shoulder cannon, and a minigun on its back. Subtle was never on the menu.")
AI_LINE(WarMachine, SuitIntro, "WARMACHINE_intro_iron_patriot", "iron-patriot", "Red, white, and blue, with a full missile rack. A flying recruitment poster that hits hard.")
AI_LINE(Friday, SuitIntro, "FRIDAY_intro_rescue", "rescue", "Blue armor, swept wings, and a cloud of repair drones. It's built to save lives, but it fights when it has to.")
AI_LINE(Edith, SuitIntro, "EDITH_intro_arachnid", "arachnid", "Nanotech spider armor with four extra waldo legs that end in blades. Your friendly neighborhood upgrade.")
AI_LINE(Ultron, SuitIntro, "ULTRON_intro_ultron", "ultron", "Chrome, gunmetal, and a cold red glare. It doesn't need strings.")
